# File reading scope

## Read (source of truth)

- `src/client/*.js` — editable client JS (never read minified copies)
- `src/**/*.astro`, `src/styles/**`, `src/data/**` — components, styles, content
- `scripts/*.mjs` — only when changing or debugging build scripts

## Never read unless the user explicitly asks

- `public/js/*.js` — terser output; read the matching file under `src/client/`
- `dist/` — Astro build output
- `node_modules/`
- `package-lock.json` — unless debugging dependency resolution
- Binary assets: images, fonts, videos under `public/` or `src/assets/`

## Scope discipline

- Read changed files plus direct imports/dependencies only
- Do not read the whole codebase to answer a localized question
- Use paths and alt text from Astro/data files instead of opening image files
